Key findings from web research:

| Search | Result |
|--------|--------|
| Crawford-Sobel + stochastic resonance | **Zero overlap.** Completely separate literatures. |
| Blau-Michaeli applied to organizational communication | **Never done.** Papers are image processing only. |
