| Atlan formalization | **Remains phenomenological.** No rigorous theorem in English literature. |
| Kosko forbidden interval applied to organizations | **Never done.** Physical/neural systems only. |
| Organizational creativity + information theory | **Not unified.** Kocak & Puranam (2024) closest but no formal mechanism. |

**Critical bridge papers found:**
- Akyol, Langbort & Basar (2015) "Strategic Compression and Transmission of Information: Crawford-Sobel Meet Shannon" — merges CS + Shannon formally, but no generativity angle
