- Kocak & Puranam (2024) "The Power of Babel" — productive misunderstanding mechanisms (truce, search, resonance), but no information theory
- Xu, Jain & Kankanhalli (2024) "Hallucination is Inevitable" (arXiv:2401.11817) — computability-theoretic proof, relevant but different angle from Blau-Michaeli

